    narr:narration """This hub is a single repeated test assertion, not a developing narrative. Every child — from [the earliest entry](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EDefaultRef1788169170042_1) through [the latest](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260924_3_E2EDefaultRef1790242255729_hc8df811a3b6d_1) — carries [the same statement](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EDefaultRef1788255387470_1), re-voiced daily across the span, including [a parallel-series entry](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2E2EDefaultRef1788301640261_1) and [a second one](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2E2EDefaultRef1788341794428_1). The children stay uniform in [conviction and temporal framing](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EDefaultRef1789723493710_1) — plain, concrete, present-tense claims — with [one entry additionally carrying a register note](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EDefaultRef1789637169682_1). There is no dissent, no drift, and no substantive variation; a query about anything beyond the repeated assertion should route elsewhere.""" ;
    narr:reaction """Nothing moved here: the new children repeat the same assertion in the same register as before, and the prior narration still holds as written.""" ;
